      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹3.90 (vs ₹4.34 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹3.90 (down from ₹4.34 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹12.7b (up 13% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹995.0m (down 5.6% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 7.9% (down from 9.4% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Revenue is forecast to grow 15% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 10% growth forecast for the Auto Components industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 7% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 25% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
